- x86: with the gate, sieve asm is BIT-IDENTICAL to the pass-disabled
  build; 162/162 regression, 653 lib tests.
- ARM: movk count in sieve loop 2 -> 1; qemu run prints 664579 (matches
  native gcc -O2); ARM differential suite holds at baseline 91 passed.
- CCC_DISABLE_PASSES=intconst escape hatch preserved.
